---
// Hero component - Clean with subtle quirk
---

<section class="hero" aria-label="Ralph introduction">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="badge-loop" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
          <path d="M12 8v4l2 2" />
        </svg>
      </span>
      AI-Agnostic Agentic Loops
    </div>

    <!-- Title -->
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      <span class="title-word title-ralph">ralph</span>
      <span class="title-word title-keeps">keeps going.</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Description -->
    <p class="hero-desc">
      Reset the context. Feed the learnings. Watch it ship.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-subdesc">
      A CLI tool that runs AI coding agents for hours, not minutes.
    </p>

    <!-- Terminal Demo -->
    <div class="terminal-wrapper">
      <div class="terminal">
        <div class="terminal-chrome">
          <div class="terminal-dots">
            <span class="dot dot-red"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-yellow"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-green"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="terminal-title">terminal</span>
          <div class="terminal-spacer"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <div class="terminal-line line-1">
            <span class="prompt">$</span>
            <span class="cmd">ralph run</span>
            <span class="arg">"Add tests for all auth modules"</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line line-2">
            <span class="loop-icon">↻</span>
            <span class="output">Loop 1: Found 12 auth modules, added tests for UserAuth...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line line-3">
            <span class="loop-icon">↻</span>
            <span class="output">Loop 2: Added tests for SessionManager, TokenService...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line line-4">
            <span class="loop-icon">↻</span>
            <span class="output">Loop 3: Added tests for OAuth, SAML providers...</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line line-5 success">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span class="output">Done. 47 test files created. All passing.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Buttons -->
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="/guides/quickstart/" class="btn btn-primary">
        Get Started
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="btn-arrow">
          <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/concepts/the-loop/" class="btn btn-ghost">
        How it works
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Feature highlights -->
  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
          <path d="M12 8v4l2 2" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-content">
        <strong>Context Reset</strong>
        <span>Fresh context window each iteration: Each loop iteration starts fresh. No accumulated confusion. The model reads your updated files and continues from where it left off.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
          <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
          <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-content">
        <strong>State Persistence</strong>
        <span>Learning is carry forward: Progress persists through your codebase. The AI reads vcs (git, jj etc) history, modified files, and test results to orient itself each iteration.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/>
          <path d="M9 9l6 6M15 9l-6 6"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-content">
        <strong>Exit Conditions</strong>
        <span>Smart stopping when done: Define when to stop: tests passing, no more TODOs, specific markers. ralph knows when the job is done.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-content">
        <strong>Tool Agnostic</strong>
        <span>Works with Claude Code, OpenCode, other cli tool adapters coming soon.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Badge */
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    border: 1px solid hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.3);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    animation: fadeSlideDown 0.5s ease-out;
  }

  .badge-loop {
    display: flex;
    animation: spin 6s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes spin {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeSlideDown {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-10px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Title */
  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 10vw, 4.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .title-word {
    display: block;
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out backwards;
  }

  .title-ralph {
    animation-delay: 0.1s;
  }

  .title-keeps {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    animation-delay: 0.2s;
  }

  @keyframes fadeSlideUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Description */
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.3s backwards;
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .hero-desc {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
  }

  .hero-subdesc {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.4s backwards;
  }

  /* Terminal */
  .terminal-wrapper {
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.7s ease-out 0.5s backwards;
  }

  .terminal {
    background: hsl(220 13% 8%);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow:
      0 4px 6px -1px hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.1),
      0 10px 20px -5px hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.15),
      0 0 0 1px hsla(0, 0%, 100%, 0.05);
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .terminal:hover {
    box-shadow:
      0 4px 6px -1px hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.1),
      0 10px 20px -5px hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.15),
      0 0 0 1px hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.2),
      0 0 30px hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .terminal-chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: hsl(220 13% 11%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(220 10% 16%);
  }

  .terminal-dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .dot-red { background: hsl(0 75% 55%); }
  .dot-yellow { background: hsl(45 100% 55%); }
  .dot-green { background: hsl(140 70% 45%); }

  .terminal-title {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    color: hsl(220 10% 50%);
  }

  .terminal-spacer {
    width: 3rem;
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .terminal-line {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: terminalLine 0.4s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .line-1 { animation-delay: 0.8s; }
  .line-2 { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
  .line-3 { animation-delay: 1.6s; }
  .line-4 { animation-delay: 2.0s; }
  .line-5 { animation-delay: 2.4s; }

  @keyframes terminalLine {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateX(-5px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
  }

  .prompt {
    color: hsl(140 70% 55%);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cmd {
    color: hsl(200 100% 70%);
  }

  .arg {
    color: hsl(200 60% 80%);
  }

  .loop-icon {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    margin-right: 0.25rem;
  }

  .output {
    color: hsl(220 10% 60%);
  }

  .terminal-line.success .check-icon {
    color: hsl(140 70% 55%);
  }

  .terminal-line.success .output {
    color: hsl(140 70% 55%);
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.6s backwards;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--sl-color-accent);
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .btn-ghost {
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
    border-color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    background: hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.1);
  }

  /* Quote */
  .hero-quote {
    max-width: 26rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
    background: linear-gradient(to right, hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.06), transparent);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.7s backwards;
  }

  .hero-quote p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .hero-quote p {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }

  .hero-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Features */
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    animation: fadeSlideUp 0.6s ease-out 0.8s backwards;
  }

  .feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    padding: 1.125rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-sidebar);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .feature:hover {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px hsla(45, 100%, 62%, 0.15);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .feature-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .feature-content strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  :root:not([data-theme='dark']) .feature-content strong {
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
  }

  .feature-content span {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 280px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .terminal-body {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
